{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 168169, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 111982, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "点火系统教学", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1664331180, "updated_at": 1666951156, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1686388479, "last_at": 1686388479, "comment_count": 35, "status": 1, "summary": "此为萌新接触点火系统必看的第一个帖子，帮助你了解点火是什么，以及如何点火。相关攻略链接：点火石挑选指南：https://dc.gamekee.com/68263.html点火是什么？有什么作用？点火，", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_727/h_714/202/63428/2022/8/28/844033.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_739/202/63428/2022/8/28/891356.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_647/202/63428/2022/8/28/211513.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 16, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 52295, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 19, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 168169, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">此为萌新接触点火系统必看的第一个帖子，帮助你了解点火是什么，以及如何点火。</span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">相关攻略链接：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">点火石挑选指南：https://dc.gamekee.com/68263.html</span><br></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火是什么？\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火是什么？有什么作用？</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">点火，是天子培养中的最后一环，也是提升最大的一环。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">提升天子练度的方式有很多：Child加值（界限突破）、装备、魂卡、温泉等级，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">最后一个则是点火。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">那么点火是如何改变天子强度的呢？</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(217, 0, 0);\">第一部分：技能质变</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">简单举例：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">我们现在有一只+6满技能的夏娃，她的技能是这样的：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"727\" data-height=\"714\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_727/h_714/202/63428/2022/8/28/844033.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_727/h_714/202/63428/2022/8/28/844033.png\"></div><div>二技能：对1名敌人造成伤害<br></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">三技能：对2名敌人造成伤害和中毒</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">大招：对全体敌人造成伤害</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">都说夏娃是六连刀，怎么是2连刀呢？</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">事实上夏娃不点火的时候就是全游戏垫底的强度，而<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(198, 1, 1);\">点火后她的技能发生了质变。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"673\" data-height=\"739\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_739/202/63428/2022/8/28/891356.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_739/202/63428/2022/8/28/891356.png\"></div>夏娃的二技能从<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(198, 1, 1);\">对1名敌人攻击变成了对2名敌人攻击</span>，发生技能质变。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">三技能<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(198, 1, 1);\">对2名敌人攻击变成了对3名敌人造成2连击！</span>超级大质变！</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">总计打出六段伤害，这就是我们所说的六连刀。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">大招<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(198, 1, 1);\">新增了对敌人的增益爆发效果</span>，同样发生质变。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">这就是点火对天子造成的影响之一，技能发生变化，整体强度直接提升了好几个Level。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(217, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: bold;\">第二部分：面板属性提高</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(217, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">点火带来的第二项提升，是天子面板数值的提升。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">这是一只没有点火的光土星面板。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"535\" data-height=\"647\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_647/202/63428/2022/8/28/211513.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_647/202/63428/2022/8/28/211513.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div>这是一只点火后的光土星面板，<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(198, 1, 1);\">使用的点火主核心为：增幅防御力-增幅攻击力-</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">HP</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"535\" data-height=\"642\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_642/202/63428/2022/8/28/463746.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_642/202/63428/2022/8/28/463746.png\"></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">忽略温泉带来的影响，点火实际上对光土星的面板提升是：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">400点红防，300点红攻，3000点HP。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火词条解析</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(174, 0, 0);\">各个点火词条带来的点火提升是什么？</span>请查看：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1499\" data-height=\"1235\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1499/h_1235/202/63428/2022/8/28/641112.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1499/h_1235/202/63428/2022/8/28/641112.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火系统怎么玩？\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火系统简介</span></div></div></span></div><div><img data-width=\"1264\" data-height=\"3440\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1264/h_3440/202/63428/2022/8/28/317866.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1264/h_3440/202/63428/2022/8/28/317866.png\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"我的角色应该如何挑选主核心？\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">主核心挑选</span></span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1379\" data-height=\"1028\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_1028/202/63428/2022/9/3/214711.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_1028/202/63428/2022/9/3/214711.png\"></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"点火实例教学\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火实例教学</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">有人看了上面的教学，依然不懂，我直接现场点火一个角色，一步步带你学习正确的点火方式。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">今天，我们要点火一只彼列。<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"813\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_813/h_1024/202/63428/2022/9/28/114937.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_813/h_1024/202/63428/2022/9/28/114937.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">好的，如果我们想给她点火，应该先干什么？</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">①去<a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DTnd6cUNFaVVhcndZ?tab=BB08J2\" target=\"_blank\">“百科全书”</a>或“新角评价”或<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/68263.html\" target=\"_blank\">“点火石挑选”</a>中寻找“彼列<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">”</span>相关的点火信息</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1037\" data-height=\"752\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1037/h_752/202/63428/2022/9/28/520324.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1037/h_752/202/63428/2022/9/28/520324.png\"></div>Ok，我们得知，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">彼列推荐使用的主核心是“增幅防御力-HP-HP”或</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“增幅防御力-HP-防御力”</span>，如果都没有的话，就选用<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">“增幅防御力-HP-任意词条”</span></span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">接下来我们打开仓库，看看我们有没有推荐的石头：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1001\" data-height=\"980\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1001/h_980/202/63428/2022/9/28/772542.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1001/h_980/202/63428/2022/9/28/772542.png\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">很幸运，我们有一颗推荐的石头</span>，我们就选它作为“彼列”的主核心了。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">主核心凑齐了，我们接下来要看狗粮核心。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">很多新手根本不知道狗粮核心有什么用，甚至还有人点火1个角色直接消耗12个极品核心，把我整笑了。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">狗粮核心就是在你选定主核心之后，完成点火的材料之一。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"878\" data-height=\"851\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_878/h_851/202/63428/2022/9/28/393713.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_878/h_851/202/63428/2022/9/28/393713.png\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">狗粮核心需要11个</span>，我们数一数，发现包里狗粮有17个（防血敏那个可以留），绰绰有余。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">再下一步，我们应该确定包里的狗粮五星角色数量，够不够支撑我们点火。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"848\" data-height=\"615\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_848/h_615/202/63428/2022/9/28/959817.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_848/h_615/202/63428/2022/9/28/959817.png\"></div>点满火一个角色需要<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">5个同属性五星</span>，OK凑齐了。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">可以开始点火了。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">我们把<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">增幅防御力-HP-HP</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">”给彼列装上，放在点火树的<span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">第一个坑位</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"840\" data-height=\"1388\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_840/h_1388/202/63428/2022/9/28/272492.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_840/h_1388/202/63428/2022/9/28/272492.png\"></div>可以看到，我们给彼列的点火石已经装上去，发现一共有3列点火树，我们叫<span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">中间这根点火树为主路径，旁边两条点火树为副路径。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">刚刚点火石的3个词条就已经放在这三条路径的顶端了，这就代表了你这个角色的发展方向。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">简单来说就是10个属性点进行分配，你点了4个防御，6个血，这样应该容易理解。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">装完了主核心，我们要开始用狗粮核心填坑了</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-width=\"1649\" data-height=\"929\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1649/h_929/202/63428/2022/9/28/219375.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1649/h_929/202/63428/2022/9/28/219375.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">后续的点火路径分为主路径和副路径两种，上面已经说过了，这两种路径的点火消耗不同。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">主路径：消耗1个点火石+1个同属性5星角色。</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">*技能变化仅仅发生在主路径上</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">副路径：消耗1个点火石。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">一共有5个主路径，6个副路径，所以在这里你需要消耗总计11个核心，5个同属性五星</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">这就是为什么我们前面准备那么久，因为这里需要消耗很多东西。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-width=\"1010\" data-height=\"1026\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1010/h_1026/202/63428/2022/9/28/687601.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1010/h_1026/202/63428/2022/9/28/687601.png\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">（点火技能变化发生在主路径，如上图）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div>好了，开始点火，把狗粮核心放进去，狗粮五星也放进去，点击确定，你就<span style=\"color: rgb(203, 3, 3);\">完成了一个小路径的点火</span>。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-width=\"1006\" data-height=\"916\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1006/h_916/202/63428/2022/9/28/263408.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1006/h_916/202/63428/2022/9/28/263408.png\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">重复上述步骤，一直到所有路径全走完，恭喜你，完成了一个角色的点火。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1084\" data-height=\"1115\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1084/h_1115/202/63428/2022/9/28/715598.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1084/h_1115/202/63428/2022/9/28/715598.png\"></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">最后你得到一个获得了400增幅防御力，6000点HP的彼列。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"396\" data-height=\"476\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_396/h_476/202/63428/2022/9/28/533950.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_396/h_476/202/63428/2022/9/28/533950.png\"></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">教程到此结束。</span></div><br></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_727/h_714/202/63428/2022/8/28/844033.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_739/202/63428/2022/8/28/891356.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_535/h_647/202/63428/2022/8/28/211513.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "last_ip_area": "江西省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee